<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>H SPORTS — Home</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
    body { background: #000; color: #fff; min-height: 100vh; }
    
    .header { text-align: center; padding: 40px 20px 30px; }
    .logo { font-size: 42px; font-weight: bold; color: #007bff; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .tagline { font-size: 16px; color: #888; }
    
    .container { padding: 20px; max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; }
    
    .main-btn {
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #007bff, #00cc88);
      color: white;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 22px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .main-btn:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
    
    .info-box {
      background: #111;
      border: 1px solid #222;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .info-box h3 { color: #00cc88; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; }
    .info-box p { font-size: 14px; color: #aaa; line-height: 1.6; }
    
    .footer { text-align: center; padding: 30px 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #444; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="header">
    <div class="logo">H SPORTS</div>
    <div class="tagline">Your Home For Live Sport</div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <a href="live.html" class="main-btn">🔴 LIVE NOW</a>
    
    <div class="info-box">
      <h3>⚽ FOOTBALL</h3>
      <p>Live matches & upcoming fixtures from leagues around the world.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="info-box">
      <h3>🥊 BOXING</h3>
      <p>Major fight nights, title bouts & all the big action.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="info-box">
      <h3>📺 How It Works</h3>
      <p>Click "LIVE NOW" → Enter password → Choose your stream → Click Watch. All streams open in new tabs.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    © 2026 H SPORTS — All streams link to official broadcasters
  </div>

</body>
</html>
